rtilizers.'>S</button><button class='periodic-element' data-name='Chlorine' data-info='Chlorine is used to disinfect water.'>Cl</button><button class='periodic-element' data-name='Argon' data-info='Argon is an inert gas used in light bulbs.'>Ar</button></div><div class='periodic-detail' id='periodic-detail'></div>"
